  "solution": "Given:\n\n sqrt{2916} = 54 \n\nCalculations:\n\n sqrt{29.16}+sqrt{0.2916}+ sqrt{0.002916} +sqrt{0.00002916}\n\n= 5.4 + 0.54 + 0.054 + 0.0054\n\n= 5.4 + 0.54 + 0.0594\n\n= 5.4 + 0.5994\n\n= 5.9994\n\n**Hence, The simplified value is 5.9994.**",
